        "product_summary": "Two black lining options: Standard Lining and Plush Lining are separate selections, each covering EU 39–48.\nDistinctive side profile: A thin lightning-like side graphic and zigzag eyestay border sit above a sculpted black sole.\nLace-up construction: Flat black laces pass through plain front openings and paired round upper eyelets.\nTread appearance: Source underside photos show separate tread pads with a fine triangular surface texture.\nForefoot and heel details: A curved stitched toe overlay and rear fabric pull loop are visible on the actual shoe photos.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
